wntown area, yet excludes adjacent","x":338,"y":598,"w":1716,"h":42},{"text":"lands nearly surrounded by the current downtown area. The proposed map corrects these","x":341,"y":662,"w":1696,"h":43},{"text":"discrepancies, and adds and subtracts other areas to align this map more closely with the","x":340,"y":725,"w":1700,"h":42},{"text":"Local Coastal Land Use Plan, ensuring that Measure D ordinances shaped by this map","x":342,"y":788,"w":1630,"h":41},{"text":"reflect the City's long-term planning goals.","x":341,"y":853,"w":801,"h":41},{"text":"10","x":2125,"y":394,"w":43,"h":46},{"text":"13","x":2124,"y":582,"w":41,"h":52},{"text":"IO)","x":2120,"y":651,"w":39,"h":44},{"text":"15","x":2127,"y":710,"w":38,"h":39},{"text":"(D","x":2113,"y":855,"w":28,"h":41}]}]}
